1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Anastasius/6000000003645870259
2 CONT
2 CONT This Anastasius was the son of Theodora’s daughter.  He is only known to have been betrothed to Joannina, daughter of Belisarius & Antonina, and was not the husband of Juliana.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00043079.1997.10786808
2 CONT
2 CONT Analysis of the mosaics in S. Vitale at Ravenna reveals two phases in the panels of Justinian and Theodora, which the histories of Procopius help to explain. The first phase, dating from 544–45 and originally including the bishop 
2 CONC of Ravenna Victor, probably shows the emperor and empress with their commander in Italy Belisarius, his wife Antonina, their daughter Joannina, and Theodora's grandson and Joannina's fiancé, Anastasius.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT
2 CONT * The Imperial Families of Ancient Rome By Maxwell Craven.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=VEbCDwAAQBAJ&lpg=PT608&ots=tM2MdsGT4z&dq=Anastasius%20was%20the%20son%20of%20Sabinianus%2C&pg=PT606#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] An
2 CONC astasius, senator in 548.  Betrothed to Belisarius’ daughter by whom he had no issue. 
2 CONT *Alan Cameron. Duke University, Greek, Roman and Byzantine Studies The House of Anastasius. Columbia University, pp 259-276. June 1978. Page 270. Accessed 9 April 2020. https://grbs.library.duke.edu/article/viewFile/7451/4919 page
2 CONC  17 of PDF.  Joannina, daughter of Belisarius & Antonina.  Betrothed to Anastasius, son of (unnamed son of Probus) & (unnamed daughter of Theodora). 
2 CONT * The Secret History By Procopius [https://books.google.com/books?id=8d4biioH-1IC&lpg=PR74&ots=GMex8D-kMA&dq=Anastasius%2C%20Theodora%E2%80%99s%20grandson&pg=PR66#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT * The History of the Decline and Fall of the Roman Empire, Volume 4 By Edward Gibbon.  Page 294.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=tyc-AAAAcAAJ&lpg=PA294&ots=4cN1gYaThT&dq=Anastasius%2C%20Theodora%E2%80%99s%20grandson&pg=PA294#v
2 CONC =onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] Joannina their daughter, and the sole heiress of their fortunes, was betrothed to Anastasius the grandson, or rather the nephew, of the empress", whose kind interposition forwarded the consummation 
2 CONC of their youthful loves. But the power of Theodora expired, the parents of Joannina returned, and her honour, perhaps her happiness, were sacrificed to the revenge of an unfeeling mother, who dissolved the imperfect nuptials befor
2 CONC e they had been ratified by the ceremonies of the church".  "Alemannus (ad Hist. Arcanam, p. 68.), Ducange(Familia; Byzant, p. 98.), and Hei- ; (Hist. Juris Civilif, p. 434.), all three  represent Anastasius as the son of the daug
2 CONC hter of Theodora; and their opinion firmly reposes on  the unambiguous testimony of Procopius  {Anecdot. c. 4, 5.—Buyar, twice repeated).  And yet I will remark, 1. That, in the year  547, Theodora could scarcely have a grandson o
2 CONC f the age of puberty; 2. That we are  totally ignorant of this daughter and her  husband; and, 3. That Theodora concealed her bastards, and that her grandson by Justinian would have been heir-apparent of the empire.”
2 CONT * Italy and Her Invaders: The imperial restoration, 535-553. 1896 By Thomas Hodgkin.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=3cxWAAAAMAAJ&lpg=RA1-PA661&ots=n8ayV-a1m0&dq=Anastasius%2C%20Theodora%E2%80%99s%20grandson&pg=RA1-PA453#v=one
2 CONC page&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT * Theodora: Actress, Empress, Saint By David Potter [https://books.google.com/books?id=sYtmCgAAQBAJ&lpg=PT190&ots=fw-sMS4oXC&dq=Anastasius%2C%20Theodora%E2%80%99s%20grandson&pg=PT190#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] the marriage c
2 CONC ollapsed (Procopius blames Antonina) and we hear nothing more for certain of Anastasius.
2 CONT * The British Chronicles, Volume 2 By David Hughes [https://books.google.com/books?id=ZABSepHO1FMC&pg=PA636&lpg=PA636&dq=flavia+Juliana+wife+of+Anastasius&source=bl&ots=GkD5kNjuV7&sig=ACfU3U2VaRToj74UpAQaEvXGxJncUunrTw&hl=en&sa=X&
2 CONC ved=2ahUKEwj087_wr73pAhVMgp4KHaXOCE4Q6AEwCHoECAgQAQ#v=onepage&q=flavia%20Juliana%20wife%20of%20Anastasius&f=false GoogleBooks] has errors 
