2 CONC am" and names her brothers "Celdebertum et Heldebertum et Thiudebertum"[30], although this is presumably an incorrect reference to her nephews and great-nephew with similar names.  m ([492] ) THEODORIC King of the Ostrogoths in It
2 CONC aly, illegitimate son of THEODEMIR King of the Ostrogoths in Pannonia & his concubine Ereleuva -- ([454]-30 Aug 526). [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#ClovisIB MEDLANDS]'''
