2 CONT Father: Theodemir, King of the Ostrogoths
2 CONT Mother: Erelieva
2 CONT Married (1): name unknown
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Arevagni
2 CONT Theodegotho
2 CONT Married (2): Audofleda
