2 CONT >>>>>a)         son (-after [556]).  Gregory of Tours refers to, but does not name, the son of King Gontran and Queen Marcatrudis, specifying that he died soon after the murder of his half-brother Gundobald[201]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>King Gontran & his second wife had four children:
