2 CONT >>>>5.         SIGEBERT ([535]-murdered Vitry [Nov/Dec] 575, bur Soissons, basilique Saint-Médard).  Gregory of Tours names (in order) Gunthar, Childerich, Charibert, Guntram, Sigibert and a daughter Clothsind as the children of K
2 CONC ing Clotaire and his wife Ingonde[212].  He succeeded his father in 561 as SIGEBERT I King of the Franks, at Reims, later at Metz. 
