2 CONT >>>>8.         CHILPERICH (before 535-murdered Chelles [27 Sep/9 Oct] 584, bur Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés).  Gregory of Tours names Chilperich as the son of King Clotaire and his wife Aregund[223].  He succeeded his father in 5
2 CONC 61 as CHILPERICH I King of the Franks, at Soissons.   
