2 CONT Relationships:
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *Clovis/Chlodovech I (446/467 - 511), King of the Franks (482-511)
2 CONT *Clotilde/Rotilde/Chrotechildis (c480-544/548), Queen of the Franks (492-511), nun at St. Martin at Tours (511-544/548)
2 CONT
2 CONT Older Half-Sibling (by Clovis' first partner, an unknown Frankish woman):
2 CONT
2 CONT *1. Theoderich I (485-533), King of the Franks (511-533)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT *2. Ingomer (493-493)
2 CONT *3. Chlodomer (494/495 - 524), King of the Franks at Orleans (511-524), husband of Guntheuca of Burgundy (her second marriage - first husband unknown)
2 CONT *4. Childebert (497 - 558), King of the Franks at Paris (511-558)
2 CONT *5 Chlothachar (501/502 - 561), King of the Franks at Soissons (511-561)
2 CONT *6 Theodechildis (492/501 - 576), Queen (unknown kingdom), founder of Mauriac monastery in Auvergne
2 CONT *7 Chrothieldis/Clotilde (502/511 - 531), wife of Amalric, King of the Visigoths
2 CONT *8 Unknown legendary daughter, mother of Agiulf, 26th bishop of Metz, and Arnold, 27th bishop of Metz
