3 CTRY Kingdom of the Vandals
1 OCCU Fourth King of the Vandals & Alans in Africa (496-523)
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ben M. Angel notes: Hasdingi was not a family name. It was the name of one of two tribal groups that consisted of the Vandals. The Silingi were the other. Both took part in the invasion westward and into Africa. Th
2 CONC rasamund's ancestors were from the Hasdingi tribe, but again, Hasdingi was not the name of a dynasty. Also, Thrasamund was clearly born in Africa, and not Gaul, given that the Vandals left Gaul in 409, 51 years before his estimate
2 CONC d birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT
