2 CONC  people had ventured to suggest that Theuderic might have had something to do with it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Radegund was then forced to marry King Clotaire, while Hermanfrid's wife Amalaberga fled to the Ostrogoths with her children Amalafrid and Rodelinda. She was later captured by the Byzantine general Belisarius and sent to Constanti
2 CONC nople, where Amalafrid later became an imperial general and Rodelinda was married to the Lombard king Auduin.
