2 CONT s/o CLOTAIRE I [Chlothachar] King of the Franks & his third wife Ingundis [Ingonde] 
2 CONT
2 CONT x m (early 566) as her first husband, BRUNECHILDIS [Brunequilda/Brunechilde] of the Visigoths, daughter of ATANAGILDO King of the Visigoths & his wife Gosvinta --- ([545/50]-Renève-sur-Vingeanne Autumn 613, bur Autun, abbaye de Sa
2 CONC int-Martin).
2 CONT * INGUNDIS [Ingonde] ([567/68]-[in Africa or Sicily] Autumn 586) x (579) HERMENEGILDO of the Visigoths, son of LEOVIGILDO King of the Visigoths & his first wife --- (-murdered Tarragona 13 Apr 586). 
2 CONT *CHILDEBERT II King of the Franks. (570-[2/28] Mar 596) x m FAILEUBA
