2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Djilka (c.343-363)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Bulümar (Balamber) "Sheke" (c.360-378)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Alyp-bi (Uldin) "Alp-abai" or "Arbat" (378-390)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Aybat (Mundzuk or Charaton) (390-434) with subordinates Octar, Roila, and Ruga.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Bleda Khan (434-445) with subordinate Attila.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Attila (Avitohol) Khan (445-453) with
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Ellac Khan (453-c.455)
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Tengiz (Dengizich) Khan (453-469) with subordinate Tuldila c.457-469.
