2 CONT "The Wild Ass"; Emperor of Sasanian Persia 421-439, persecuted Christians
2 CONT Fought the Ephthalites
1 NOTE OR "BAHRAM GOR"; KNOWN AS "THE WILD ASS"; KING OF KINGS 421-439; PERSECUTION OF
2 CONT THE CHRISTIANS
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://www.american-pictures.com/genealogy/persons/per03149.htm#0
