2 CONT The 342 date may have come from the date of the last known coin under Rhescuporis, which was in 341. The only question is whether Airmanareiks conquered them as king. Perhaps he established his supremacy from having already conque
2 CONC red the Bosporan Kingdom - this of course is purely speculation (you simply can't tell that much from a complete or possibly incomplete set of coins).
2 CONT
