2 CONT
2 CONT Ben M. Angel on the photo: Despite how popular that Airmanareiks (Ermanarich, Jormunrek, etc.) has been in literature, there are very few images relating to him. The image I'd have preferred would have been the plaque dedicated to
2 CONC  him from the Walhalla in Donaustauf in Bavaria, but no one has bothered to post a photograph of it on the web. However, the good folks at "Dragon - Action Figuren" came up with a solution - yes, the "Ermanrich the Goth" action fi
2 CONC gure. That's right, if this is your ancestor, then one of your ancestors has his own actual action figure - how cool is that?
