2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * The Late Latin poet Venantius Fortunatus wrote a long commemorative poem (Carmina VI.5) in honour of Galswintha.[b]
2 CONT * Symphonic metal band Leaves' Eyes also wrote a song from their album Symphonies of the Night titled "Galswintha".
