1 NOTE Galeswintha, sister of Brunhilde, was also daughter of Athangild, King of the Spanish Visigoths, probably the younger, born about 536.
2 CONT
2 CONT Galeswintha, sister of Brunhilde, was killed by her husbnad Chilperic in order to marry his mistress Fredegund.  Some sources say she was killed by Fredegund.  bef 575.
1 NOTE Assassinated by her husband, Chilperic and his mistress, Fredegunde.
