1 OCCU Queen consort, Queen consort of Chilperic I & Queen Regent of her son., Queen consort of Chilperic I, Dronning av Frankrike, Reine de Neustrie, [Cambrai], Queen, Evil Bitch, Queen Consort, Servant, concubine (serving-woman), then 
