2 CONC hi. According to the medieval Georgian… …   Wikipedia
2 CONT * Anchiskhati Basilica — The Anchiskhati Basilica of St Mary (Lang ka|ანჩისხატი) is the oldest surviving church in Tbilisi, Georgia. It belongs to the Georgian Orthodox Church and dates from the sixth century. HistoryAccording to 
2 CONC the old Georgian annals, the church was… …   Wikipedia
