1 TITL Ispahbod of Khorasan
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In 537, Khusro Anushirvan made Zarmihr of the House of Qaren the Governor of Tabaristan and Padeshkargar.
2 CONT
2 CONT In about 650, Tabaristan was conquered by the Sassanid Governor of Gilan Dabuy who established the independent kingdom of Deyleman. Dabuy got his title of Padashwargarshah from Yazdegerd III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Soon afterwards, however, the Qarens managed to reak off from the shackles of thew Padhuspanis.
