2 CONT
2 CONT Ben M. Angel's summary: Vultwulf having lived from 300 to 370 may be correct, though this is not sourced. He apparently preceded Airmanareiks (Hermanrich) and the arrival of the Huns. Likely, he was Achiulf's eldest son (though FM
2 CONC G's Medlands lists Ansila and Ediulf as being the likely eldest sons).
2 CONT
2 CONT The only other information that I've been able to find is that Vultwulf was renowned for his "valor". What caused him to be renowned did not make it into Getica, but his valor was used for comparison with his grandson, Vinitharius
2 CONC , noted as the last leader of Ostrogoth resistance to the Huns.
2 CONT
2 CONT He likely ruled over a people called the Greuthungi. This may not have been a large tribe of people, but they were probably the people that the Amal Dynasty led before the formation of the Ostrogoths. The Greuthungi Goths were a p
2 CONC art of the larger Chernyakhov Culture that dominated the Scythian plains (present Ukraine) before the arrival of the Huns.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternate spellings: Vultuulf, Vulthulf, Vuldulf.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT From the Foundation for Medieval Genealogy page on Hungary:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/HUNGARY.htm#_Toc146273199
2 CONT
2 CONT ACHIULF . Iordanes names "Achiulf et Oduulf" as the sons of Athal[32].
2 CONT
2 CONT a) ANSILA .
2 CONT
2 CONT Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[33].
2 CONT
2 CONT b) EDIULF .
2 CONT
2 CONT Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[34].
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT c) VULTWULF .
2 CONT
2 CONT Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[35].
2 CONT
2 CONT i) VALARAVANS .
2 CONT
2 CONT Iordanes names "Valaravans" as the son of Vultwulf[36].
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT d) HERMENRICH .
2 CONT
2 CONT Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[39].
2 CONT
