2 CONC public festivities that accompanied the erection ofthe statues as the final straw in the strained relationship betweenEudoxia and the bishop, John Chrysostom.
2 CONT
2 CONT [[23]]For examples see W. Mayer, "Constantinopolitan Women inChrysostom's Circle", Vigiliae Christianae 53 (1999) 284-5.
