2 CONT     Emperor of Rome in the East 378-394
2 CONT
2 CONT     Emperor of Rome 394-395
2 CONT
2 CONT     Theodosius was the son of the famous general Flavius Theodosius and was born in Spain. As a young man, he often accompanied his father in the British campaigns, but when he later died Theodosius retired to Spain. When the Roma
2 CONC n Emperor Valens in the East died in 378, his co-Emperor Gratian in the West appointed Theodosius to rule the East as Emperor. In 382, Theodosius finally compromised with the invading Visigoths that they could remain in the Empire
2 CONC  as long as they served in the army.
2 CONT
2 CONT     When the Roman Emperor Gratian died in 383, Theodosius recognized the usurper Maximus as Emperor in the West with the exception of Italy, where Valentinian II ruled as Emperor. In 388, Maximus attacked Theodosius, however Theo
2 CONC dosius defeated and killed him, returning sole rule fo the West to his co-Emperor Valentinian. In 392, Valentinian's general Arbogast killed the Western Emperor and gave the crown to Eugenius as a puppet ruler in his place. Theodo
2 CONC sius marched to Italy and defeated the two pretenders in 394, becoming the first sole Roman Emperor since the Emperor Jovian died in 364. He formally divided the Roman Empire on his death permanently into two separate, independent
2 CONC  empires of the West and the East. He was succeeded by his sons Arcadius and Honorius to the East and West respectively.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Noteringar 
2 CONT
2 CONT Under Emperor Valentinian I, Flavius Theodosius had been stripped of command and exiled to Spain. His father had been executed, possibly for interceding on behalf of his son. Despite such inasupicious beginnings, Theodosius, with 
2 CONC his eight-year-old son was installed in name as ruler of the Western Empire.
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodosius var den siste att regera hela det Romerska riket, om än bara för en kort tid. Han är även känd för att ha gjort kristendomen till officiell statsreligion i hela riket.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans söner blev kejsare över Östromerska-, respektive Västromerska riket.
2 CONT
