1 NOTE Ruled 428 to 477. Illigitamate son of Godigisal.
2 CONT Vandal king who Ruled Vandalucia, Hispania in Baetica Southern Spain. The Visigoths forced him to leave Hispania and he took Carthage right from under the Roman's noses.
2 CONT The Visigoths eventually replaced the Vandals at Vandalucia and Iberia.
2 CONT Geisderic took Licinia Eudoxia and her daughter, Eudoxia to Cathage where Eudoxia married Huneric King of the Vandals and Alans.
