2 CONT ==========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT 53. FAUSTINA OF ROME OR (L) FLAVIA was born BET 312 AND 341.  
2 CONT
2 CONT      Children of FAUSTINA OF ROME OR (L) FLAVIA and CONSTANS I (NOTES) AUGUSTUS(L) WEST ROMAN EMPIRE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT     i. Constantia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     ii. FLAVIUS (NOTES) THODOSIUS COUNT (L) COCO-SEGOVIA was born BET 316 AND 330 in Caus Castle, Salop, and died BET 375 AND 376 in Carthage, Africa. He married THERMANTIA I DE ROME OR (L) PULCHERIA. She was born BET 324 AND 332,
2 CONC  and died 386.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     iii. PIRESMESSER OR PIRCMESSER (L) BYZANTINE was born BET 340 AND 390. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 26.   iv. CONSTANTINE CONSTANTIUS III (NOTES) EMP (L) ROME was born BET 351 AND 390, and died BET 421 AND 431. He married AELIA GALLA PLACIDIA OR (L) PLACIDA, daughter of THEODOSIUS I (L) DE CAUCA and Galla Valentiniana of (L) ROM
2 CONC E. She was born BET 300 AND 390, and died 27 NOV 450.  
2 CONT
2 CONT     v. MAXIMIAN-CONSTANS (NOTES) (L) DE ROME was born BET 275 AND 320, and died 337. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     vi. HELEN was born ABT 320. She married JULIAN THE APOSTATE. He was born ABT 320.  
2 CONT
