2 CONT
2 CONT 54. THEODOSIUS I (L) DE CAUCA was born BET 11 JAN 347 AND 11 JAN 357 in Cauca, Gallaccia, Spain, and died BET 17 JAN 394 AND 17 JAN 395 in Milan, Italy. He was the son of 108. FLAVIUS (NOTES) THODOSIUS COUNT (L) COCO-SEGOVIA and 1
2 CONC 09. THERMANTIA I DE ROME OR (L) PULCHERIA. 
