2 CONC E OR (L) FLAVIA. He was born BET 351 AND 390, and died BET 421 AND 431. She married EUDAF (NOTES) HEN KING (L) DE BRITAIN, son of EINUDD (NOTES) AP (L) GWRDDWFN OF (L) BRITAIN. He was born BET 283 AND 286 in NORTH BRITAIN. She mar
2 CONC ried ATHANARIC (NOTES) KING OF THE (L) VISIGOTHS, son of ATHANARIC OF THE (L) VISIGOTHS. He was born BET 338 AND 370, and died 381.  
