2 CONT Ernakh / Irnek / Hernach / Belkermak
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Attila the Hun. Ruler of the Utigurs and Altyn Ola.
2 CONT
2 CONT 469
2 CONT
2 CONT With battles against the Ostrogoths and Eastern Romans seemingly ongoing for the past decade, Dengisich of the Kutrigurs is now killed by Anagastes, the Roman general in Thrace, and his head is taken to Constantinople to be parade
2 CONC d through the city. His brother, Ernakh, is probably now the dominant Hunnic ruler on the Pontic-Caspian steppe. His fate is unknown, suggesting a peaceful end for a ruler who is more content with the lands under his control than 
2 CONC had been the case with his brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT
