2 CONT ID: I83048 Name: Ernak of the Huns Prefix: King Given Name: Ernak Surname: of the Huns Sex: M _UID: AA14D13D4E04D74597AA3EBE495BF3899726 Change Date: 7 Jul 2005 Birth: ABT 432 Death: 476 Father: ATTILA @ OF THE HUNS b: 392 Marriag
