2 CONT Three brothers: 
2 CONT *1.         OCTAR .  Iordanes names "Attila patre genitus Munduzco" and his "germani Octar et Roas", recording that they held the kingdom before Attila[83]. 
2 CONT *2.         ROAS .  Iordanes names "Attila patre genitus Munduzco" and his "germani Octar et Roas", recording that they held the kingdom before Attila[84]. 
2 CONT *3.         MUNDUZCO .  Iordanes names "Attila patre genitus Munduzco" and his "germani Octar et Roas", recording that they held the kingdom before Attila[85].  Munduzco had [three] children: 
