2 CONC  of Northumbria and Æthelberg (?). (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 February 670. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Oswiu, King of Northumbria succeeded to the title of King Oswiu of Northumbria in 642. (1) He annexed Mercia to Northumbria. (3)
