2 CONT Petronius Probianus (floruit 315-331) was a politician of the Roman Empire.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Life===
2 CONT * Probianus was a member of the Petronii Probi, a family of the senatorial aristocracy. 
2 CONT * He was the son of Pompeius Probus, consul in 310, 
2 CONT * the father of 
2 CONT # Petronius Probinus, consul in 341, 
2 CONT # and of the poet Faltonia Betitia Proba, 
2 CONT * the grandfather of Sextus Petronius Probus, consul in 371.
2 CONT *Probaianus was proconsul of Africa in 315-317, consul in 322, and praefectus urbi (of Rome) from October 8, 329, to April 12, 331.
2 CONT
