1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Theodoric I, king of the Visigoths 
2 CONT * Reign: 418 – June 451 AD
2 CONT * Predecessor: [https://www.geni.com/people/Wallia-king-of-the-Visigoths/6000000003645870055 Wallia]
2 CONT * Successor: [https://www.geni.com/people/Thorismund-king-of-the-Visigoths/6000000000499350741?through=6000000010646052427 Thorismund]
2 CONT * Died: 20 June 451 
