1 NAME Æthelheard, King of the Hwicce
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 709
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Witnessed charter of 693 issued by his presumed father Oshere.
2 CONT
2 CONT Styled "rex" on a spurious charter dated 709 issued by the King of Mercia.  Although the charter is spurious, the witness-list is likely to be taken from a genuine charter; there would be no point in the forger putting in a king o
2 CONC f a dynasty of a now defunct kingdom unless he was copying from a genuine contemporary document.
