2 DATE AFT 706
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Witnessed charters issued by his father Oshere in 692 and 693. In a charter issued by the King of Mercia in 706 he was styled "sub-regulus" (sub-king) and Oshere is specifically stated to have been his father. In a
2 CONC  further Mercian charter dated 716/717 an Æthelweard, possibly or probably the same person, is styled "dux" (ealdorman); a further demotion as the Hwicce were absorbed into Mercia.
