2 CONC II 571, no. 15, and pl. 18, no. 15. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 13Rufinus, Hist. Eccl . 1.11 (ed. Migne) or 10.12 (ed. Mommsen); Theodoret, Hist. Eccl . 2.2 (ed. Migne) or 2.3.2 (ed. Parmentier-Scheidweiler); Philostorgius, Hist. Eccl ., ed. Bidez-Winkelmann (GCS XXI) 182; Alexander P. Kazhdan
2 CONC , "Constantin imaginaire," Byzantion 57 (1987) 196-250 at 201-202. 
