1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was a descendant of the Gordiani family of Dardania, and was one of the most considerable nobles in that region. His great grandson Julius boasted that the family was descended from the warlike Maesians. The Dar
2 CONC danians dwelt on the edge of Maesia.
