2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Seeck in RE VI.2 (1909) 2084; Mattingly-Sydenham , RIC VII, index of obverse legends, 724; Jones-Martindale-Morris, PLRE I 325; Barnes, New Empire 43; Kienast, Kaisertabelle 2305. 
