2 CONT born c340 - 388	Magnus Clemens Maximus
2 CONT First marriage of Magnus Maximus to Ceindrech ferch Reiden.
2 CONT born c354 - 388	Victor ap Macsen
2 CONT born c358	Eugenius / Owain Finddu 'Black Lips'
