2 CONT
2 CONT _________. "Valerius (Diocletianus) (142)." RE 7: col.24199ff. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Groag, E. "Maxentius." RE 14: 2417ff. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jones, A.H.M., J.R. Martindale, and J. Morris. "M. Aur. Val. Maximianus signo Herculius 8." The Prosopography of the Later Roman Empire , Cambridge, 1971, 1.573ff. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ________. J.R. Martindale, and J. Morris. "Eutropia 1." The Prosopography of the Later Roman Empire , (Cambridge, 1971), 1.316. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kienast, Dietmar. Römische Kaisertabelle: Grundzüge einer römischen Kaiserchronologie . Darmstadt, 1990. 
2 CONT
