1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gochihr
2 CONT
2 CONT Gochihr (also spelled Gozihr) was an Iranian dynast from the Bazrangid dynasty, who ruled Istakhr as a Parthian vassal in the early 3rd century. He was a prominent ruler during the last years of the Parthian empire which had been 
2 CONC weakened by internal conflicts and war with the Romans. He was killed in 205 or 206 by the Iranian prince Pabag, who had conquered his domains.
