1 CONT Theodora became pregnant with him by one of her lovers/husbands whileshe was an actress. She tried to abort it, but failed, and the boy's father, afraid that she would resort to infanticide, took him away to Arabia. When the fathe
1 CONC r died and John was in his teens, he learned thewhole story of his birth and his mother, and returned to Byzantium. When he entered the Empire and made his presence known, John was quickly called to the court by his mother, now Em
1 CONC press (wife of Justinian).Theodora did not want her husband to find out about John, so she had him killed.
