1 CONT taken during a battle against Alemanni. After her husband's death in 511, she
1 CONT retired to Tours, France and became famous for her sanctity of life,
1 CONT generosity to the church (Sainte-Genevieve) that they had cofounded in Paris,
1 CONT and charity work. She had one sister, with whom she took refuge after their
1 CONT parents were murdered by their uncle Gundobad sometime before 500 AD.
