1 CONT [mergebase.FTW]
1 CONT King of the Visigoths 507-531
1 CONT At the death of his father, the weak king Alaric II, in battle with Clovis I, King of the Franks, Amalaric became king. He went on to make peace with Clovis and married his daughter Chrotilda. As his wife wasa Catholic, and himsel
1 CONC f an Arian, he mistreated her very badly. In 531, she wrote to her brother Childebert I, King of Paris, and Amalaric was killed.
