1 CONT to 571 AD. Sigbert I  was murdered at the instigation of Fredegund, mistress
1 CONT of his 1/2 brother Chilperic, in 575. Brunhild, his widow, was imprisoned at
1 CONT Rouen. Sigebert and his 1/2 brother, Chilperic,  were hostile to each other,
1 CONT especially after the murder of Galswintha, his sister-in-law, by Chilperic.
