0 @N6000000003495155317@ NOTE
1 CONT King of Paris 561-567
1 CONT Charibert inherited the kingdom of Paris on the death of his father Chlotar in 561. His brief reign in Paris was uneventful, and his kingdom was divided between his brothers on his death.
