0 @N6000000002240782047@ NOTE Neustria: a Frankish kingdom to the west of neighboring Austrasia, later
1 CONT becoming part of western France. Chilperic, a Merovingian king of Siossons
1 CONT whom historian Gregory of Tours called the Nero and the Herod of his age,
1 CONT was ambitious, brutal, and debauched, but had pretensions to being a man of
1 CONT learning. He wrote poor poetry, ordered four letters added to the alphabet,
1 CONT and regarded the church as a major rival to his wealth, treating the bishops
1 CONT with contempt and displaying injustice & imposing high taxes on his subjects.
