0 @N6000000002187665839@ NOTE Chram
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Chram, son of Clotaire I and Ingund.
1 CONT
1 CONT Chram rose in rebellion against his father Clotaire, a king of the Franks, on several occasions. Following one of these rebellions, he fled to Brittany with his wife and children, pursued by his father. Upon catching them, Clotair
1 CONC e imprisoned Chram and his family in a cottage and set fire to it.
