1 CONC Gundobald in 585, Childebert threw himself unreservedly into the arms of Guntram.
1 CONT By the Treaty of Andelot of 587, Childebert was recognised as Guntram's heir, and with his uncle's help he quelled the revolts of the nobles and succeeded in seizing the castle of Woëwre. Many attempts were made on his life by Fre
