0 @N6000000001876715868@ NOTE Source    http://vandeleurcreagh.org/b9.htm#P10491
1 CONT Clotaire II King of All Franks was born in 584 in Paris. He died in 629. Parents: Chilperic I de SOISSONS King of the Franks and Fredegunde d' ARDENNES.
1 CONT Spouse: Sichilde d' ARDENNES. Clotaire II King of All Franks and Sichilde d' ARDENNES were married. Children were: Chilperic, Oda.
1 CONT Spouse: Haldetrude. Clotaire II King of All Franks and Haldetrude were married. Children were: Dagobert I King of Austrasia and Neustria.
