1 CONT     440's - annexed Balearic Islands, Sardinia, Corsica, and Sicily
1 CONT     June 455 - sacked Rome
1 CONT     460 - defeated Romans led by Majorian
1 CONT     468 - defeated Romans led by Basiliscus
