0 @N6000000000435268388@ NOTE King of Kent (640)
1 CONT
1 CONT Said by the venereable Bede to be the first English King to order the destruction of Idols throughout his kingdom. He also ordered everyone to observe lenten fasts.
0 @N6000000001353855774@ NOTE Ruled BET. 640 - 664 King of Kent
