0 @N6000000002176675395@ NOTE Edwin was expelled by Aethelfrith of Bernicia 616. Then, w/ Raedwald, King of
1 CONT East Anglia, Edwin defeated Aethelfrith and formed a united Northumbria in 616
1 CONT  extending as far north as Edinburgh. Later, at Hatfield in 633, he was
1 CONT defeated and slain in battle against Cadwallon of North Wales and Penda of
1 CONT Mercia. After Edwin's death, Northumbria fell apart, and Christianity, for
1 CONT awhile, was extinguished in Northern England. Edwin was succeeded by his
1 CONT brother, Oswald.
