1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Mundzuk (Priscus: ????d??????) was the brother of Rua, the Hunnish King. His sons, Bleda and Attila, shared the throne from 434 until 445AD, when Attila supposedly killed Bleda.
0 @N6000000002188001725@ NOTE Bleda
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Bleda (Priscus: ???da?; Procopius: ???da?) the Hun was born around 390 A.D. As nephews to Rua, Bleda and his younger brother Attila succeeded him to the throne. His reign lasted for 11 years until he died in 445 A.D. While it has 
1 CONC been speculated throughout history that Attila murdered him on a hunting trip, no one knows how he died.
1 CONT
