0 @N6000000002188198175@ NOTE Vasudeva II
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Vasudeva II was a Kushan emperor around 290-310 AD.He was the son of Kanishka III and through him the Grandson of Vasudeva I . He is reported to have had a son named Vasudeva III .
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] References
1 CONT This article does not cite its references or sources.
