1 CONT Fu Pi of Former Qin Emperor of China (Inner Mongolia)
1 CONT 386-409
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Murong Bao of Later Yan Emperor of China (Shanxi)
1 CONT 396-409
1 CONT Emperor of China (Hebei)
1 CONT 397-409
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Murong De of Southern Yan Emperor of China (Huatai region)
