1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Maxentius
1 CONT Augustus in the west
1 CONT Dresden bust of Maxentius
1 CONT Reign 28 October 306 -
1 CONT 28 October 312
1 CONT
1 CONT (in competition with Severus, then Galerius then Constantine - jointly with his father 306-8)
1 CONT Full name Marcus Aurelius Valerius Maxentius
1 CONT Born c. 278
1 CONT Died 28 October 312
1 CONT Rome
1 CONT Predecessor Constantius Chlorus
1 CONT Successor Constantine
1 CONT Wife/wives Valeria Maximilla
1 CONT Issue Valerius Romulus,
1 CONT 1 other son of unknown name
